---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const description = 'Dudley Development is an independent iOS studio building focused iPhone apps with clear product loops, privacy-aware defaults, and launch-ready craft.';
---
<Base title="About Dudley Development" description={description} path="/about/">
<main class="resource-page" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<section class="resource-hero" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<a class="back" href="/" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>← Home</a>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Independent iOS studio</p>
<h1 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Small apps with real product taste.</h1>
<p class="resource-lede" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
Dudley Development builds focused iPhone apps that start from a clear loop:
        rate the moment, start the conversation, play the joke, or learn one useful idea.
        The apps are small on purpose: easy to understand, quick to open, and built around one
        thing they should do well.
</p>
<div class="resource-actions" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<a class="btn primary" href="/#viberater-social" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>See VibeRater</a>
<a class="btn" href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Contact the studio</a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="resource-band" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>What to expect</p>
<h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Apps that explain themselves, respect your time, and make help easy to find.</h2>
</div>
<div class="principle-grid" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<article data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>01</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Product loops first</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Each app earns its place with a repeatable behavior, not a vague category pitch.</p>
</article>
<article data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>02</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Privacy-aware defaults</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Support and privacy pages stay close to the product model, with no fake “trust us” gloss.</p>
</article>
<article data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>03</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Launch-ready craft</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>App Store copy, icons, support, web pages, and growth content move together.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="resource-band" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Current portfolio</p>
<h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Live apps stay easy to find, with client work separated from Dudley-owned products.</h2>
</div>
<div class="resource-list" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<a class="resource-row" href="/apps/monetary-policy-independence-day/" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<img src="/assets/powell-prowl-icon.png" alt="Monetary Policy: Independence Day app icon" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<b data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Monetary Policy: Independence Day</b>
<small data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>A satirical iPhone arcade game where Fed independence explodes into 100 levels of chaos</small>
</span>
<em data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Live</em>
</a><a class="resource-row" href="/apps/vibe-rater/" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<img src="/assets/vibe-rater-icon.png" alt="VibeRater Social app icon" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<b data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>VibeRater Social</b>
<small data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>v2.1 live with Full Screen, Rodeo, Repli, Radar events, following, and search</small>
</span>
<em data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Live</em>
</a><a class="resource-row" href="/apps/table-talk/" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<img src="/assets/table-talk-icon.png" alt="Table Talk: Conversation Cards app icon" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<b data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Table Talk: Conversation Cards</b>
<small data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Shuffle through conversation-starter cards for dinner tables, dates &amp; friends</small>
</span>
<em data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Live</em>
</a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="resource-band" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<div data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Client work</p>
<h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Partner builds get their own lane.</h2>
</div>
<div class="resource-list" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<a class="resource-row" href="/apps/wheres-this-house/" rel="noopener" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<img src="/assets/wheres-this-house-icon.png" alt="Where's This House? app icon" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<span data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<b data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Where&#39;s This House?</b>
<small data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>v2.0.1 live on iPhone + iPad · Created for HomeLight</small>
</span>
<em data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Client</em>
</a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="resource-contact" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
<h2 data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>Support and press are direct.</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>
For app help, email <a href="mailto:support@dudleyapps.com" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>support@dudleyapps.com</a>.
        For partnerships, launch questions, or studio notes, email
<a href="mailto:hello@dudleyapps.com" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r>hello@dudleyapps.com</a>.
</p>
</section>
</main>
